Package: policybrief
Title: Create Professional Policy Briefs in HTML
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("EMERGE", "Team", email = "emerge@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generate publication-ready policy briefs as standalone HTML documents.
    Designed for researchers and public policy managers who need to communicate 
    research findings to non-specialized audiences. Provides a standardized 
    structure (cover, executive summary, context, findings, recommendations, 
    institutional info) with customizable colors, logos, images, and section content.
    Follows World Bank and international policy brief best practices.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
